### Final Controller Note

Your controller should now return `ApiResponse<Object>` to allow the `JsonNode` to be rendered correctly as a JSON object in the final response.

```java
@GetMapping("/summary/{id}")
public ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<Object>> getSummary(@PathVariable Long id) {
    return ResponseEntity.ok(ApiResponse.success(service.getOrGenerateLhoSummary(id)));
}

```

